et.journal.gear.ab12.d:
Seals you in a bubble (6 sec) that absorbs 12.0% damage;
after 6 sec the bubble bursts,
dealing 120% magic damage to enemies within 4 blocks

et.journal.gear.bc11.d:
Each attack has an 8% chance to light a bonfire underfoot
(radius 2.5, 8 sec, only one at a time;
hitting several enemies at once counts as one attack);
allies by the fire gain +7.5% attack

et.journal.gear.bc12.d:
Casts a net in a 60° cone 8 blocks ahead;
normal enemies are rooted for 3 sec (elites and above immune),
and netted enemies take +9.0% damage for 10 sec

et.journal.gear.fw13.d:
In combat, stores 1 Sunlight every 10 sec (up to 3);
when a single hit deals more than 10% of your max health,
consumes 1 to restore 6.0% health

et.journal.gear.pm12.d:
In combat, lights a guiding lantern every 20 sec (up to 2);
when a single hit deals more than 10% of your max health,
a lantern shatters and grants an 8.0% absorption shield (10 sec)

et.journal.gear.un01.d:
Opens Gate A underfoot and Gate B where you're looking (up to 15 blocks);
the gates persist, and casting again moves them;
any ally who walks into one gate is teleported to the other
(after teleporting, a player can't enter any gate for 90 sec)

et.journal.gear.un03.d:
Spreads a 10-block shadow circle underfoot for 20 sec that follows you:
allies inside are stealthed and unaware monster packs won't notice them;
leaving the circle reveals you, and attacking or taking damage breaks it (can't be used in combat)

